@OrderApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Create a Valid Order (Hexagonal Driving Adapter with DTOs)
# 2 keyboards @ $60 = $120 -> 10% discount applied by Domain = $108
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Alice Johnson",
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "Ergonomic Keyboard",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 60.00
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Create an Invalid Order (Empty Items -> Caught by Domain Invariant!)
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Bob Smith",
  "items": []
}

### 3. Create an Invalid Order (Empty Customer Name -> Caught by Domain Invariant!)
POST {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "   ",
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "Mousepad",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 15.00
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Get Order by GUID (Replace {{orderId}} with GUID returned from POST)
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{OrderApi_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
